<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Personal on Best of AI</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tags/personal/</link><description>Recent content in Personal on Best of AI</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-US</language><lastBuildDate>Mon, 07 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://bestofai.io/tags/personal/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>khazix-skills</title><link>https://bestofai.io/skills/kkkkhazix-khazix-skills/</link><pubDate>Mon, 07 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/skills/kkkkhazix-khazix-skills/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;This repository bundles the following skills:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;leader&lt;/strong&gt;: Turns vague ideas into clear, actionable goals an agent can execute independently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;storage-analyzer&lt;/strong&gt;: Scans system disk usage and flags files for safe deletion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;aihot&lt;/strong&gt;: Fetches daily AI news summaries and trends without requiring an API key.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;neat-freak&lt;/strong&gt;: Aligns project documentation and CLAUDE.md files and audits rule execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;hv-analysis&lt;/strong&gt;: Produces long research reports, roughly 10,000 to 30,000 words, analyzing products or companies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;khazix-writer&lt;/strong&gt;: Writes long-form content in the creator&amp;rsquo;s specific style, tone, and voice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</description></item><item><title>Zetik</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/zetik/</link><pubDate>Mon, 31 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/zetik/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Zetik positions itself as a personal intelligence staffer: it monitors podcasts, academic papers, code activity, social posts, and news for the subjects a user tells it to track, then compresses everything into a short brief instead of leaving the user to hunt through separate feeds. The pitch is similar to how an executive relies on staff to stay current, applied to an individual&amp;rsquo;s own interests.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The product launched on Product Hunt in August 2026 and climbed to the top of the daily leaderboard within its first two weeks. Its makers have said Claude Code was central to building it, taking the project from prototype to a shipped product quickly with a small team.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Elastic AI Assistant</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/elastic-ai-assistant/</link><pubDate>Fri, 17 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/elastic-ai-assistant/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Brave Leo</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/brave-leo/</link><pubDate>Sun, 21 Sep 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/brave-leo/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Google Assistant</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/google-assistant/</link><pubDate>Sun, 21 Sep 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/google-assistant/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Meta AI</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/meta-ai/</link><pubDate>Sun, 21 Sep 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/meta-ai/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Pi</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/pi-ai/</link><pubDate>Sun, 21 Sep 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/pi-ai/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Replika</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/replika/</link><pubDate>Sun, 21 Sep 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/replika/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Siri</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/siri/</link><pubDate>Sun, 21 Sep 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/siri/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Alexa AI</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/alexa-ai/</link><pubDate>Sun, 15 Jun 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/alexa-ai/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Anna</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/anna-ai/</link><pubDate>Wed, 01 